  Business Requirement:
    Create a Virtual Data Source (VDS) in the Engine Folder to monitor APU health for B737NG aircraft by extracting APU performance data from AMOS, including part numbers, serial numbers, aircraft registration, and CT5ATP trend values with the latest reference date for each APU.

  Source Database : amos_postgres
  Source Tables (3):
    - amos.rotables
    - amos.rotables_trend
    - amos.aircraft

  Output Fields (9):
    - partno: APU Part Number
    - serialno: APU Serial Number
    - psn: Unique PSN (Part Serial Number) associated with each APU Serial Number
    - ac_registr: Aircraft Registration
    - ref_date: Reference Date converted from integer to date format (latest date only for each APU)
    - trend_type: Trend Type (CT5)
    - event_perfno_i: Work Order number if present
    - value: CT5ATP value representing APU performance metric
    - ac_typ: Aircraft Type

  Transformations (5):
    - Convert ref_date from integer (BIGINT) to date format using DATE_ADD function with base date of 1971-12-31
    - Filter trend_type to uppercase 'CT5' values only
    - Filter aircraft type to uppercase 'B737NG' only
    - Rank rotables_trend records by PSN partition ordered by ref_date descending to identify latest record per APU
    - Select only the latest reference date record for each APU (row number = 1)

  Filters (3):
    - UPPER(rt.trend_type) = UPPER('CT5')
    - UPPER(a.ac_typ) = UPPER('B737NG')
    - rn = 1 (latest record per APU based on ref_date)

  Acceptance Criteria (8):
    - Query returns only APUs fitted to ASL AC Type B737NG aircraft
    - Each APU is represented by its latest reference date only
    - All required fields are present: APU P/n, APU S/n, PSN, Aircraft Reg., Reference Date, CT5 trend type, Workorder, CT5ATP value, and Aircraft Type
    - Reference dates are properly converted from integer format to readable date format
    - Trend type is filtered to CT5 values only
    - VDS is created in the Engine Folder in Dremio
    - Query handles null workorder values appropriately
    - Results match the sample output showing 27 rows of B737NG APU health data
